  "title": "Melt In Your Mouth Pumpkin Bread",
  "description": "This recipe yields two moist pumpkin loaves that are melt in your mouth good from the flavorful combo of pumpkin and instant coconut cream pudding mix.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
